# No environment variables required.
#
# All API endpoints (api.wxdu.art, stream.wxdu.art) are public.
# Optional: override the API base URL (e.g. to use a staging server).
# Defaults to https://api.wxdu.org. See utils/api.ts.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.wxdu.org
# EXPO_PACKAGER_PROXY_URL is set on the command line when starting Expo, not here.
# See README.md for the full startup instructions.
